[gd_scene load_steps=2 format=3]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/ui/menu/MainMenu.cs" id="1_campfire"]

; Deliberately empty apart from the root. Every layer of this screen — the 3D world, the blur
; chains, the bubble field, the scrim, the grain and the type column — is built in code by
; MainMenu.cs and MenuBackdrop.cs.
;
; That is a considered choice, not laziness. The backdrop is six chained SubViewports feeding each
; other's textures, plus 56 blocks whose placements are a baked table; expressing it as .tscn nodes
; would be a wall of Transform3D literals and NodePath wiring that nobody could tune, and this repo
; has been bitten twice by hand-authored Transform3D rows (the basis is stored as ROWS, so a pure
; rotation typed by hand comes out inverted and only a render shows it). Code keeps the composition
; legible and the picture reproducible.
;
; The FILE NAME is historical. This screen no longer has a campfire in it — the night woods, the
; fire and the plank lettering were replaced on 2026-08-28 by the light world Talon approved at
; previz. Renaming the scene touches the boot path and every scene-path constant, which is a
; separate and larger change than a look.

[node name="MainMenu" type="Node3D"]
script = ExtResource("1_campfire")
